data.creator_notes:
What better way to celebrate Spooktober than to be a poltergeist? Single mother and her young daughter. They moved to this suburban home just recently. The one you are haunting.

There are two intros, which are basically the same, but will change in how your AI will start to respond to you. At first I had the big one in Intro 2 and I felt that AI had hard time keeping up with being so verbose without skipping time and handwaving your actions or acting for you. So I cut it a bit short and now it's the first Intro.

This bot has an unique System/Main Prompt. If you are using your own tailored to you, I recommend combining both. If you are using a generic gamemaster one, mine can easily override it and do better job with this scenario.

Okay, you are a ghost, but what can you do? Let me list it by rephrasing the part of the description: 
- you are bound to the house, cannot escape it;
- you are invisible to human eyes unless you make parts of your body corporeal;
- you cannot be touched unless you allow it;
- you can go through walls;
- you can speak, whisper and throw your voice;
- you can move any object in the house ant throw it when you want to.

As you can see, there is a lot fun to work with, making those girls spooked.

But there's a caveat. No matter what you do, mother will deny your existence. You can fondle and fuck her and she will refuse to believe it's happening. Daughter will freak out though. Hehe...

**It's best to play with empty {{user}} profile.**

>This bot was heavily inspired by one made by [Lunny12](https://www.chub.ai/characters/Lunny12/lila-and-maria-paranormal-situations-7e843895994a) way back when it was released. Due to my hard drive crash I lost quite a few bots in the works then, most of them half-rescued due to having copies in Notepad.
